1
00:00:00,017 --> 00:00:01,127
The alert said:

2
00:00:01,147 --> 00:00:02,836
avoid anyone
acting strangely.

3
00:00:02,903 --> 00:00:04,136
It was Halloween.

4
00:00:04,156 --> 00:00:06,444
Three blocks
to get Mia home.

5
00:00:06,661 --> 00:00:07,694
Half the street

6
00:00:07,714 --> 00:00:09,300
was dressed as zombies.

7
00:00:09,567 --> 00:00:11,505
Some of them
weren't pretending.

8
00:00:12,072 --> 00:00:14,009
Then the screaming
didn't stop.

9
00:00:14,326 --> 00:00:15,912
[MIA] Which ones are real?

10
00:00:16,276 --> 00:00:17,463
Two ways home:

11
00:00:17,483 --> 00:00:19,272
the bright,
crowded street…

12
00:00:19,292 --> 00:00:21,409
…or the empty,
dark alley.

13
00:00:21,642 --> 00:00:22,742
In the dark,

14
00:00:22,762 --> 00:00:24,812
you can't see
what's coming.

15
00:00:24,879 --> 00:00:26,466
Kai took the light.

16
00:00:26,633 --> 00:00:28,016
It was cold enough

17
00:00:28,036 --> 00:00:29,623
to see your breath.

18
00:00:29,890 --> 00:00:31,273
Every costume around him

19
00:00:31,293 --> 00:00:32,178
was breathing.

20
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:33,524
Except one.

21
00:00:35,090 --> 00:00:36,253
The living breathe.

22
00:00:36,273 --> 00:00:39,612
On a cold night,
you can see it.

23
00:00:39,879 --> 00:00:41,587
Puff. Puff. Puff.

24
00:00:41,607 --> 00:00:42,366
Nothing.

25
00:00:42,929 --> 00:00:44,867
[GUEST] Stay away from Mr. Pell!

26
00:00:45,429 --> 00:00:47,330
The scariest
costume was breathing.

27
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:49,070
The friendliest
face wasn't.

28
00:00:52,037 --> 00:00:53,182
They can push.

29
00:00:53,202 --> 00:00:55,327
They can't turn
a handle.

30
00:00:55,694 --> 00:00:57,643
Two breaths
on the glass.

31
00:00:57,663 --> 00:00:58,633
Both alive.

